  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 - Rebuild with new interfaces for user and group role management.\n\t\t\t1.1.3 - Rebuild with Unix epoch extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.1.2 - Rebuild with geographic coordinate obfuscation.\n\t\t\t1.1.1 - Rebuild with default timestamp for service result.\n\t\t\t1.1.0 - Moved user and group roles management to a separate project.\n\t\t\t1.0.12 - Rebuild with enum extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.11 - Rebuild with OIDC API implementation flag.\n\t\t\t1.0.10 - Rebuild with type for geographic coordinates.\n\t\t\t1.0.9 - Rebuild with optional leading/trailing whitespace in key-value pair lookup.\n\t\t\t1.0.8 - Set key ID in JWT header when signing with symmetric key.\n\t\t\t1.0.7 - Rebuild with optional clock skew parameter in token validation parameters.\n\t\t\t1.0.6 - Rebuild with new metadata method.\n\t\t\t1.0.5 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum.\n\t\t\t1.0.4 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum.\n\t\t\t1.0.3 - Rebuild with updated interface for string conversion methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.2 - Initial revision, targetting .NET 8",
